      "id": "2505.07906",
      "versioned_id": "2505.07906v1",
      "title": "Image-Guided Microstructure Optimization using Diffusion Models: Validated with Li-Mn-rich Cathode Precursors",
      "authors": [
        "Geunho Choi",
        "Changhwan Lee",
        "Jieun Kim",
